    "detailed_description": "<strong>One More Hound!</strong> is a hand-draw roguelite game where you'll fight against waves of enemies with unique characteristics, unlock new powers and beat your own records one match after another!<br>After been teleported by a mysterious creature to this Galatic arena, you will need to fight to survive round after round to see your love-one again!<br> <br>- Infinite Rounds<br>- Simple Commands<br>- Figure out how to defeat your enemies<br>- Beat your top score rounds in your personal ranking<br>- Create your best strategy to survive more rounds<br>- Cute visual<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546750/extras/c828a3a3389fe91442284ff708399558.poster.avif?t=1710162709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546750/extras/c828a3a3389fe91442284ff708399558.webm?t=1710162709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546750/extras/c828a3a3389fe91442284ff708399558.mp4?t=1710162709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546750/extras/a89066a2f4cf6da8cbc3d201237c6ad2.poster.avif?t=1710162709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546750/extras/a89066a2f4cf6da8cbc3d201237c6ad2.webm?t=1710162709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546750/extras/a89066a2f4cf6da8cbc3d201237c6ad2.mp4?t=1710162709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
